crates/packsmith-mcversion/data/**

  Contains data derived from Minecraft: Java Edition, which is copyright
  Mojang AB / Mojang Studios. It is included for interoperability and is NOT
  covered by the licence grants above. Each file carries
  `SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-Minecraft-Derived` and a provenance
